# Project plan

The agreed plan is `docs/plan.md`. Read it before planning, coding, testing, or setting up builds.

- Work only on a task listed under "Задачи" in that file, in its order.
- If a request is outside the plan, say so and stop. Do not widen scope.
- Stack, platforms, minimum versions, and the verdict wording are fixed by the plan. Do not change them silently.
- Dictionary statuses stay off the screen until the user accepts them.
- Secrets never go into git.
